sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant O as Orbit
  participant D as Disk
  U->>O: Edit note
  loop Every 2s while typing
    O->>D: Debounced save
    D-->>O: ok
  end
  alt Changed on disk
    O->>U: Load theirs / Keep mine
  else No conflict
    O-->>U: Saved
  end
  Note over O,D: Atomic write (temp, fsync, rename)
